- content_for :title, "Beginners Guide - Coming Soon"

.max-w-6xl.mx-auto.px-4.sm:px-6.lg:px-8.py-8
  / Breadcrumb
  = render 'shared/breadcrumbs', breadcrumbs: [{ title: 'Home', path: '/' }, { title: 'Beginners Guide', path: nil }]

  / Main Content Card
  .bg-white.rounded-lg.shadow-lg.overflow-hidden
    / Header Section
    = render 'shared/page_header', title: 'Beginners Guide', subtitle: 'Everything you need to get started with Baldrick boards', image_url: 'baldrick-logo-dynamic.svg'

    / Content Section
    .px-8.py-8
      .max-w-4xl.mx-auto
        .prose.max-w-none
          / Coming Soon Message
          .bg-gradient-to-r.from-blue-50.to-indigo-50.rounded-xl.p-8.border-2.border-blue-200.shadow-lg.mb-8
            .text-center
              .mb-6
                svg.h-16.w-16.text-blue-500.mx-auto.mb-4 fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"
                  path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"
              
              h2.text-3xl.font-bold.text-gray-900.mb-4 Coming Soon!
              
              p.text-lg.text-gray-700.mb-6
                | We're working hard to create a comprehensive beginners guide that will help you get started with running your own light show.
                | In the meantime, you can find help through some of the resources below:
          / Alternative Resources
          .grid.md:grid-cols-2.gap-6.mb-8
            .bg-white.border.border-gray-200.rounded-lg.p-6
              h3.text-xl.font-semibold.text-gray-900.mb-4 Need Help Now?
              p.text-gray-700.mb-4
                | While we work on the beginners guide, you can find help through these resources:
              .space-y-3
                = link_to support_path, class: "block text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-800 font-medium" do
                  | Contact Support
                = link_to faq_path, class: "block text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-800 font-medium" do
                  | Frequently Asked Questions
                = link_to "https://www.facebook.com/groups/ilightthat", target: "_blank", class: "block text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-800 font-medium" do
                  | Facebook Community

            .bg-white.border.border-gray-200.rounded-lg.p-6
              h3.text-xl.font-semibold.text-gray-900.mb-4 Board Documentation
              p.text-gray-700.mb-4
                | Each Baldrick board has its own detailed documentation:
              .space-y-3
                = link_to board_path('baldrick8'), class: "block text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-800 font-medium" do
                  | Baldrick8 Documentation
                = link_to board_path('baldrick17'), class: "block text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-800 font-medium" do
                  | Baldrick17 Documentation
                = link_to boards_path, class: "block text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-800 font-medium" do
                  | All Board Documentation
